{"t":"Cake (Decorated)","s":"cake-decorated-f0ca1","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Cake_Decorated_70bd54.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Cake (Decorated)</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Cake (Decorated)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Decorated_70bd54.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a><br/>Party Items</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">180 seconds<br/><small>(15% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.9<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 12, 2006<br/>Christmas Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20061229141700&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Decorated_70bd54.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a cake.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 6.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It is nicely decorated with fruits and icing.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Mmmm.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Made with oven and <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a>. It can be decorated using any sort of fruit, and once placed a candlestick onto it, it becomes a Party Cake.\n<br/>\n</p>\n<table id=\"w-toc\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<p><b>How to make a Decorated Cake</b>\n</p><p>To make a <i>Decorated Cake</i>, you need...\n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a> (can be gotten by harvesting <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">wheat</a> in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">millstone</a>)<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Oven\">Oven</a><br/>\nA Fruit (check table of fruits you may use here)<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Kitchen%20Knife\">Kitchen Knife</a><br/>\n</p><p>1. Get the milk into a trough or <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">bucket</a>.<br/>\n2. Use flour with milk. You will get <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">cake dough</a>.<br/>\n3. Use the cake dough with an oven. You will get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">cake</a>.<br/>\n4. Use the knife on a fruit (check table of fruits you may use here) while having the cake in your <a href=\"#/wiki/Backpack\">backpack</a>. If you've done this correctly, there will now be red decorations on your cake, forming your <i>Decorated Cake</i>.<br/><br/>\nNote: You can make it become a Party Cake by placing a Candlestick onto it.<br/>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br/>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p>One of these is needed during the <a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a>.<br/>Create 20 of these to obtain the With a Cherry on Top achievement and half of the Piece of Cake achievement.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Backpack\">Backpack</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">Bucket</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">Cake</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Keep%20Isle\">Cake Keep Isle</a></li><li>Candlestick</li><li>Cooking</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li>Fruit</li><li>Green Sparkles Effect</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kitchen%20Knife\">Kitchen Knife</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">Millstone</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Oven\">Oven</a></li><li>Party Cake</li><li>Party Items</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a></li><li>Rookgaard Food</li><li>Status Effects</li><li>Trough</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">Wheat</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["krailos-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"krailos-quest","quest":"Krailos Quest","step":"3-1","n":37,"title":"Juntar a comida","kind":"needed","coords":[{"x":33684,"y":31723,"z":7,"label":"Barril com a Ogre Beer"}]}]}}